---
description: Use uploaded logos, icons, and artwork as-is; do not recreate them as vectors
alwaysApply: true
---

# Use uploaded images, not vectors

When the user uploads logos, icons, photos, or other artwork, put those files in the product and display them.

- Copy the files into the repo (usually `public/brand/`) and reference them with `<img>` or Next Image.
- Do not trace, redraw, or "clean up" uploaded images as SVG, icon fonts, CSS drawings, or generated marks unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not substitute a vector recreation for a logo, app icon, or UI icon the user provided.
- Prefer the uploaded lockup/wordmark files on light surfaces. If a file has a baked-in light background, use the uploaded app-icon/mark file on dark chrome rather than redrawing the mark.
